ioners. \n \nFurther, action on adoption of the notifications will be taken based \non the final decision taken on the recommendations of the committee. \n***** "}, {"k": "questions|ls|17|10|STARRED   |6", "t": "Coal Royalty", "head": "GOVERNMENT OF INDIA \nMINISTRY OF RAILWAYS \n \nLOK SABHA \nUNSTARRED QUESTION NO.6 \nTO BE ANSWERED ON 07.12.2022 \n \nDEVELOPMENTAL WORKS ON BANKURA-MASAGRAM RAILWAY LINE \n \n6.  SHRI SAUMITRA KHAN: \n \n     Will the Minister of RAILWAYS be pleased to state: \n \n(a) whether  various developmental works have been completed in \nrespect of Bankura – Masagram railway line;  \n \n(b)  if so, the details of works completed so far; and \n \n(c)  if not, the reasons therefor? \n \nANSWER \n \nMINISTER OF RAILWAYS, COMMUNICATIONS AND \nELECTRONICS & INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY \n \n(SHRI ASHWINI VAISHNAW) \n \n(a) to (c): Bankura-Masagram (116.90 km) which consists of Bankura -\nRainagar Gauge conversion (96 km) and Rainagar -Masagram new line \n(20.90 km) has been commissioned in phases from 2005 -06 to 2013-14.  \nFollowing developmental works have been done after commissioning \nthe line: \n1) Crossing station with 2 additional loop each, one additional \nplatform each and Foot Over Bridge (FOB) and other \nmiscellaneous works at both Sonamukhi and Bowaichandi \nRailway stations. \n2) Railway electrification of Bankura – Rainagar Rail line. \nFurther, developmental work is an on-going process. \n***** "}, {"k": "questions|ls|17|10|STARRED   |60", "t": "National Creche Scheme", "head": "������������������� �\n��������������������������������������� �\n��\n��� ������� �\n���������������������� �\n���������������������������� �\n��\n�������� �������������� �\n�\n���������������������������������������� �\n��\n�������������������������������������� ���� ������������������ �����������������������\n�\n���� �����������������������������������������������������������������������������������\n���� ���������������������������������������������������